<section class="section section-alt faq-section" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="faq-aside" data-reveal="fade-right">
        <span class="section-subtitle"><%- icon('message') %> FAQ</span>
        <h2>Questions, <span class="gradient-text">Answered</span></h2>
        <p class="lead">Everything you need to know before your first visit. Still have questions? We're just a phone call away.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:24px">Ask a Question <span class="arw"><%- icon('arrow-right','ico-xs') %></span></a>
        <div class="faq-contact-mini">
          <span>Prefer to talk?</span>
          <a href="tel:<%= business.phone %>"><%= business.phoneDisplay %></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-main" data-reveal="fade-left">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Is chiropractic treatment safe?</span>
            <%- icon('chevron-down','faq-chevron') %>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Chiropractic care is widely recognized as one of the safest non-invasive, drug-free therapies for neuromusculoskeletal complaints. At SpineVita, every adjustment is preceded by a thorough exam to ensure it's the right approach for your specific condition. Serious adverse events are extremely rare, and our board-certified chiropractors use only evidence-based techniques.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>How many visits will I need?</span>
            <%- icon('chevron-down','faq-chevron') %>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>It depends on your condition, how long you've had it, and your overall health. Many patients feel meaningful relief within 4–8 visits, while chronic or complex cases may need a longer plan. After your initial assessment, we'll give you a clear, written treatment plan with an estimated timeline — no surprises, no pressure to continue beyond what you need.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Do you accept my insurance?</span>
            <%- icon('chevron-down','faq-chevron') %>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>We accept most major insurance plans including BlueCross BlueShield, UnitedHealthcare, Aetna, Cigna, Humana, and Medicare. We also handle auto-accident injury claims on a lien basis — meaning no upfront cost to you for qualifying cases. Call us at <%= business.phoneDisplay %> and we'll verify your benefits before your first visit.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>What should I expect at my first appointment?</span>
            <%- icon('chevron-down','faq-chevron') %>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Your first visit takes about 45–60 minutes. We start with a consultation to understand your history and goals, then perform a physical exam including posture analysis, range-of-motion testing and any necessary orthopedic tests. If needed, we'll refer you for X-rays. In most cases you'll receive your first gentle adjustment on the same day.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Is a chiropractic adjustment painful?</span>
            <%- icon('chevron-down','faq-chevron') %>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Most patients feel immediate relief after an adjustment, not pain. You may hear a gentle "pop" — that's just gas releasing from the joint, similar to cracking your knuckles. Some patients experience mild soreness for a day afterward, similar to post-workout soreness. If you're nervous about manual adjustments, we also offer low-force and instrument-assisted techniques that are extremely gentle.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Can you help with auto-accident injuries?</span>
            <%- icon('chevron-down','faq-chevron') %>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Absolutely. Auto-accident injuries — especially whiplash, neck pain and back pain — are one of our specialties. We work on a lien basis, meaning we defer payment until your case settles, so there's no upfront cost to you. We also coordinate directly with your attorney and insurance company, and provide detailed documentation to support your claim.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt blog" id="blog">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="blog-head">
      <div>
        <span class="section-subtitle"><%- icon('file-text') %> From The Blog</span>
        <h2 class="display-3" style="margin-top:12px">Everything You Didn't Know About Chiropractic Care</h2>
      </div>
      <a href="/blog" class="btn btn-outline">View All Articles <%- icon('arrow-right','ico-xs') %></a>
    </div>

    <% const featured = posts[0]; %>
    <div class="blog-featured">
      <div class="img">
        <img src="<%= featured.image %>" alt="<%= featured.alt %>" width="600" height="340" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="txt">
        <div class="meta"><span class="cat"><%= featured.category %></span><span><%= featured.date %></span><span>· <%= featured.readTime %></span></div>
        <h3><%= featured.title %></h3>
        <p><%= featured.excerpt %></p>
        <ol>
          <% featured.content.slice(1, 4).forEach(point => { %>
          <li><%= point.heading.replace(/^\d+\.?\s*/, '') %></li>
          <% }) %>
        </ol>
        <a href="/blog/<%= featured.id %>" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:8px">Read Full Article <span class="arw"><%- icon('arrow-right','ico-xs') %></span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="blog-grid">
      <% posts.slice(1).forEach((post, i) => { %>
      <article class="blog-card hover-lift" data-reveal data-delay="<%= i + 1 %>">
        <div class="img">
          <img src="<%= post.image %>" alt="<%= post.alt %>" width="400" height="200" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="txt">
          <span class="cat"><%= post.category %></span>
          <h4><%= post.title %></h4>
          <p><%= post.excerpt %></p>
          <a class="lnk" href="/blog/<%= post.id %>">Read article <%- icon('arrow-right','ico-xs') %></a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
